<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Permissions on Sebastian Korotkiewicz - Tech{{log}}</title><link>https://sekor.eu.org/tags/permissions/</link><description>Recent content in Permissions on Sebastian Korotkiewicz - Tech{{log}}</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 31 Mar 2022 18:05:52 +0200</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://sekor.eu.org/tags/permissions/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Learning Chmod Permissions in 30 Seconds</title><link>https://sekor.eu.org/techlog/learning-chmod-permissions-in-30-seconds/</link><pubDate>Thu, 31 Mar 2022 18:05:52 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://sekor.eu.org/techlog/learning-chmod-permissions-in-30-seconds/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="scary-about-drwxr-xr-x"&gt;Scary about &amp;ldquo;drwxr-xr-x&amp;rdquo;?&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Don&amp;rsquo;t worry, in 30 seconds you&amp;rsquo;ll be able to read it!&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Chmod always contains three groups, the first is &lt;em&gt;&lt;code&gt;(u)ser&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/em&gt;, then &lt;em&gt;&lt;code&gt;(g)roup&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/em&gt; and finally &lt;em&gt;&lt;code&gt;(o)ther (public)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;-|rw-|r--|r-x&#10; | 1 | 2 | 3&#10; | u | g | o&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;(&lt;code&gt;u&lt;/code&gt;)ser: user can (&lt;code&gt;r&lt;/code&gt;)ead and (&lt;code&gt;w&lt;/code&gt;)rite&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;(&lt;code&gt;g&lt;/code&gt;)roup: user in this same group can (&lt;code&gt;r&lt;/code&gt;)ead.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;(&lt;code&gt;o&lt;/code&gt;)thers/public: can (&lt;code&gt;r&lt;/code&gt;)ead and e(&lt;code&gt;x&lt;/code&gt;)ecute.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ol&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-txt" data-lang="txt"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;U = User (1)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;G = Group (2)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;O = Other (Public) (3)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;R = Read&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;W = Write&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;X = Execute&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="give-permisions"&gt;Give permisions:&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;chmod ugo+rwx hey.txt&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>